WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,960
It turns out I didn’t want to give money to the driver.

2
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:03,440
But put it in that opening

3
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:05,600
And it only costs two yuan to get to the next stop

4
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:09,400
The young man at the labor market station has arrived.

5
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:16,280
Let's get off the car, old man

6
00:00:16,750 --> 00:00:18,710
I want to pay you back. No need.

7
00:00:18,710 --> 00:00:20,790
It's only two dollars, what you want is what you want

8
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:21,870
How can we not use it?

9
00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:22,910
you helped me

10
00:00:22,910 --> 00:00:24,110
If I'm really penniless

11
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:25,070
Then I will remember your love

12
00:00:25,070 --> 00:00:26,230
Just give it back to you next time

13
00:00:26,590 --> 00:00:27,750
But now I have money

14
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:29,190
It's just that I don't have any change

15
00:00:29,190 --> 00:00:30,230
Of course you have to pay back the money

16
00:00:30,230 --> 00:00:34,840
You are waiting for me here hehe

17
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:35,760
young man

18
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:36,960
You can do that

19
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:40,440
Buy me some water, old man. You should be busy then.

20
00:00:40,440 --> 00:00:41,640
I went over there to find a job.

21
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:42,640
Wait a minute, young man

22
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:45,660
You can do whatever job you want

23
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:47,100
My home is being renovated

24
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:49,260
Need to move some things upstairs

25
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:51,060
can you do this kind of work

26
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:55,340
If you can do it, come with me, Brother Xiao, it’s okay, old man

27
00:00:55,340 --> 00:00:57,540
Can I ask my friend to come with me?

28
00:00:57,540 --> 00:00:58,580
Come in with me first
